<h1>Define XY Grid (Mesh)</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>This command is accessible from <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Mesh &gt; Create XY Grid &gt; Define</b></span>.</p>
<p class="Description"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span></b> <span class="Command">Define XY Grid</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command generates point cloud from mesh selection. This command is unavailable if there is no selection or all selections are hidden. It works on wholly selected entities as well as on partial selection.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">The points from the point cloud are projection on the selection from OXY plane.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-left:40px;"><img src="../Mesh/images/XYGrid_dialog.gif" width="332px" height="290px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Start Point X, Y</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Specifies X and Y co-ordinates of the starting point of the projection plane. They are automatically calculated according to the selection XY extents.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>End Point X, Y</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Specifies X and Y co-ordinates of the end point of the projection plane. They are automatically calculated according to the selection XY extents.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Spacing X, Y</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Specifies X and Y spacing of the grid. Default values are 1mm for each.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Total number of points</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Displays the number of points of the XY grid that is to be generated.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Name</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Specifies the name of the resulting XY grid. Default name is 'XY Grid N', where N is the number of the subsequent newly created point cloud.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example in Front (OXY) view</a></span></p>
