<p class="Warning"><span lang="EN-US">If the grid must be in other co-ordinate frame (OYZ, OXZ), then rotate the object at the proper axis (for defining grid on OYZ, rotate the object 90 degrees around OY axis, for defining grid on OXZ, rotate the object 90 degrees around OX axis) and call</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Define XY Grid</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">command.</span></p>
<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Command">Define XY Grid</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to define exact XY grid on scan data and meshes in order to inspect only the points that are at certain distance to each other.</span></p>
